ainbow Trout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rainbow_Trout_b08ae9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mammoth Whopper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mammoth_Whopper_989942.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\"><img alt=\"Green Perch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Perch_8933ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map grimlund\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"91\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_grimlund_de414f.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Inukaya</b> is the settlement of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoyas\">Chakoyas</a>. Their locomotion method mainly consist in extenses long tunnels built underneath the igloos. The camp is situated on the island <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a>, just east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> and can be accessed through a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a>.\n</p><p>To use the sled from <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> you must finish <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a> mission 5. You also need to carry <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> with you.\n</p><p>This place is home of the <a href=\"#/quest/inukaya-quest\">Inukaya Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Grimlund NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sinatuki\">Sinatuki</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sinatuki\"><img alt=\"Sinatuki\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sinatuki_8fcb8e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">South-eastern <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\